flowchart TB
  Receive[评论 @ / 回复通知 / 私信] --> Parse[CommentRootResolver / DM 消息归一化]
  Parse --> Policy[SocialPolicyGate 平台 UID / 通道权限]
  Policy --> Select{业务分流}
  Select -->|普通评论或 DM| Batch[interactionBatcher]
  Select -->|可信主人或好友评论| Trusted[ownerCommentAgent]
  Select -->|认证主人 DM| OwnerDM[ownerDmAgent]
  Batch --> Assemble[SocialContextAssembler]
  Trusted --> Assemble
  OwnerDM --> Assemble
  Assemble --> Memory{记忆可见性}
  Memory -->|认证主人私信| Private[主人私有记忆]
  Memory -->|公开评论及其他 DM| Social[memoryRetriever.socialContext UID 隔离]
  Assemble --> Video[视频简介 / 字幕 / 验证根评论 / 楼中楼 / @ 首轮热评]
  Assemble --> Meme[本地梗检索]
  Assemble --> Persona[成长 / 人格 / 情绪 / 关系元数据]
  Private --> Model[安全模型调用]
  Social --> Model
  Video --> Model
  Meme --> Model
  Persona --> Model
  Model --> Decision{回复 / 沉默 / 行动}
  Decision -->|动作| Guard[自主意愿与平台权限 / 二次授权]
  Guard --> Send[Bili MCP / Python 最终校验]
  Send --> Receipt[真实回执 / 不确定不重复发送]
  Receipt --> Event[SocialInteractionCoordinator 幂等投影]
  Decision -->|沉默| Event
